<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;">-</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> 字段元数据由后端接口 GET /api/customer/field-config 返回</span></span>
